          "text": "NCPA Live Makes Historic Overseas Debut with \"The Merry Widow\"\n\nThe National Centre for the Performing Arts (#NCPA) in #Beijing marked a major milestone tonight with the first international livestream of its NCPA Live series. In celebration of its 18th anniversary, the NCPA presented a spectacular 4K UHD(Ultra High Definition) + 5.1 surround sound broadcast of its production of Franz Lehár's operetta \"The Merry Widow\", reaching audiences in #Malaysia for the very first time. The livestream was simultaneously screened across #China, including in #HongKong and #Macao."
